@startuml SIMDP_Backup_Recovery_Strategy
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam handwritten false
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #333333
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
}
skinparam database {
  BorderColor #2563EB
  BackgroundColor #EFF6FF
}
skinparam folder {
  BorderColor #16A34A
  BackgroundColor #F0FDF4
}
skinparam note {
  BorderColor #F59E0B
  BackgroundColor #FFFBEB
}

title SIMDP — Strategi Backup & Recovery Data

actor "Operator / Admin Teknis" as Operator

rectangle "Aplikasi SIMDP" as App {
  rectangle "Next.js App\n(login, dokumen, dashboard)" as NextApp
}

database "Database PostgreSQL\n(katalog data)\n- User\n- Pegawai\n- Metadata dokumen\n- Audit log\n- Settings" as MainDB

folder "Document Storage\n(map/arsip file)\n- PDF\n- Foto profil\n- File dokumen" as MainStorage

rectangle "Backup Job Otomatis\n(cron / script / Supabase backup)" as BackupJob

folder "Backup Database\npg_dump .sql.gz\n+ checksum\n+ encryption" as DbBackup
folder "Backup Storage\ntar.gz / bucket sync\n+ checksum\n+ encryption" as StorageBackup
folder "Offsite Backup\nlokasi terpisah\nS3/R2/Drive/server backup" as Offsite

rectangle "Restore Environment Sementara\n(local / staging / VPS sementara)" as RestoreEnv {
  database "Restore DB" as RestoreDB
  folder "Restore Storage" as RestoreStorage
  rectangle "App diarahkan ke\nDB + Storage restore" as RestoreApp
}

rectangle "Validasi Restore" as Validation {
  rectangle "1. DB tables ada" as V1
  rectangle "2. Data pegawai cocok" as V2
  rectangle "3. File dokumen bisa dibuka" as V3
  rectangle "4. Login/admin test" as V4
  rectangle "5. Audit log terbaca" as V5
}

rectangle "Keputusan" as Decision {
  rectangle "PASS\nRecovery siap" as Pass
  rectangle "PASS WITH NOTES\nAda catatan" as Notes
  rectangle "FAIL\nPerbaiki backup/restore" as Fail
}

Operator --> BackupJob : setup jadwal backup
NextApp --> MainDB : baca/tulis data
NextApp --> MainStorage : upload/download file

MainDB --> BackupJob : dump database
MainStorage --> BackupJob : archive/sync storage
BackupJob --> DbBackup
BackupJob --> StorageBackup
DbBackup --> Offsite : copy terenkripsi
StorageBackup --> Offsite : copy terenkripsi

Operator --> RestoreEnv : saat drill / bencana
DbBackup --> RestoreDB : restore pg_dump
StorageBackup --> RestoreStorage : extract/sync file
RestoreDB --> RestoreApp
RestoreStorage --> RestoreApp

RestoreApp --> Validation
Validation --> Pass
Validation --> Notes
Validation --> Fail

note right of MainDB
Database = katalog arsip.
Kalau hilang, sistem tidak tahu
file milik siapa/statusnya apa.
end note

note right of MainStorage
Storage = isi map arsip.
Kalau hilang, metadata masih ada
tapi file tidak bisa dibuka.
end note

note bottom of BackupJob
Backup harus otomatis.
Bukan tombol admin manual.
Production wajib encryption + offsite.
end note

note bottom of RestoreEnv
Restore jangan langsung ke production.
Uji dulu di environment sementara,
baru cutover kalau valid.
end note

note bottom of Decision
Yang mes lakukan sekarang:
- DB local restore: PASS
- Storage local restore: PASS
- Status total: PASS WITH NOTES
- App-level restore smoke: PASS
  seed + build + login/pages 200
- Document download smoke: PASS
  5 PDFs streamed with checksum
- Encryption check: PASS
- Offsite backup: BLOCKED
  target/credential not configured
end note

@enduml
